page_context[1]:
  - title: "Downloads"
    permalink: "https://runink.org/downloads/"
    date: "2026-08-11T00:00:00Z"
    category: "page"
    description: "Get the Runink FACE app for Android, the separate Runink PULSE app, read about the open-source Runink River workstation, or request access to the Runink Server image, which puts Runink TIDE on hardware you own."
    content: " Downloads Take Runink FACE with you, or run the platform on your own hardware. Four separate things live on this page. Runink FACE is our main product. It reads your logistics records on its own and drafts the action; a named person approves it. Runink PULSE is a different product for market analysis and marketing, listed here because it ships an app too, not because it is part of FACE. The Runink Server image is neither: it is the server image carrying Runink TIDE, a separate product in its own right, which is the answer to where your data is processed and who can see it. Runink River is the open-source developer workstation the server image is built on. Runink FACE — the product — Android Operations, in your pocket The cockpit for Runink FACE: the ranked queue of proposed actions, the records behind each one, and the approve or reject. A debug-signed build you install directly. It is not signed for the Play Store. Download APK Runink PULSE — a separate product — Android Run your agency from the field Market analysis and marketing work, with the same review-and-approve step in front of the material it drafts. A different product from FACE, with its own paper. A debug-signed build you install directly. It is not signed for the Play Store. Download APK Runink Server — the server image Runink Server The Runink Server image puts Runink TIDE on your own box: the layer FACE and PULSE run on, so that your data and the reasoning over it never leave hardware you own. Provisioned per deployment, not offered as a public download. It is built on Runink River, the developer workstation. Request Access Runink River — open source The developer workstation, open source Runink River is the free, open-source operating system for data, analytics and AI workstations you own, and the base the server image is built on. Every line of it is public. About Runink River "
